[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13380.469, "timestamp": "03:43:00", "text": "还有另一种，它像一只鸽子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13382.309, "timestamp": "03:43:02", "text": "你认为它是只白乌鸦吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13385.269, "timestamp": "03:43:05", "text": "我根本没看到白乌鸦。”所以你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13387.429, "timestamp": "03:43:07", "text": "你明白我的意思吗？两者兼有。就像你一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13390.15, "timestamp": "03:43:10", "text": "你听了别人的故事，然后你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13393.67, "timestamp": "03:43:13", "text": "你查一下，看看是不是真的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13396.389, "timestamp": "03:43:16", "text": "所以两者兼而有之。所以这真是太……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13398.309, "timestamp": "03:43:18", "text": "空白问题。所以我这就走"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13400.71, "timestamp": "03:43:20", "text": "中间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13404.15, "timestamp": "03:43:24", "text": "是的。因为两者都是。我想两个都看看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13405.99, "timestamp": "03:43:25", "text": "是的。我通常两个都去。我不去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13408.71, "timestamp": "03:43:28", "text": "就好像我不会听见一样，显然如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13410.389, "timestamp": "03:43:30", "text": "你踏入人生，显然就是要走向未来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13413.349, "timestamp": "03:43:33", "text": "听故事。实际上有很多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13416.55, "timestamp": "03:43:36", "text": "是的。所以你不能只是像“我是我是”这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13419.03, "timestamp": "03:43:39", "text": "就像我要变成一台机器机器人一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13421.349, "timestamp": "03:43:41", "text": "它没有感情。不，你不能这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13423.91, "timestamp": "03:43:43", "text": "那。你必须，你必须听。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13427.11, "timestamp": "03:43:47", "text": "故事，但你也必须有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13429.83, "timestamp": "03:43:49", "text": "一些关于事实之类的标签。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13432.63, "timestamp": "03:43:52", "text": "所以你可以说，“啊，是的，你是……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13435.51, "timestamp": "03:43:55", "text": "疯狂的。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13437.59, "timestamp": "03:43:57", "text": "你知道我的意思？你可以保留一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13439.67, "timestamp": "03:43:59", "text": "密切关注那些家伙。你喜欢"}]